 "words": 207,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Keep your life free from the love of money",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be content with what you have today",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He has said I will never leave you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nor forsake you in the long way",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So we can say with confidence now",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord is my helper I will not be afraid",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What can anyone do to me",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He stands beside us in the shade",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Remember your leaders who spoke the word",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Consider how their lives turned out",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Imitate their faith in the light",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stand firm when the shadows are out",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus Christ is the same yesterday",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And today and forever he remains",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus Christ is the same yesterday",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And today and forever he holds us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be carried away by strange teachings",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is good for the heart to be strong",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Strengthened by grace and not by rules",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where the true and living grace is sung",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We have an altar they cannot eat from",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The high priest carries blood inside",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the bodies are burned outside the camp",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the place where the truth abides",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus Christ is the same yesterday",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And today and forever he remains",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus Christ is the same yesterday",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And today and forever he holds us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He is the same yesterday",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And today and forever",
   "heard": 4,
